<%- include('partials/head') %>
<section class="home-hero">
  <div class="reveal reveal-left">
    <h1>Build your way out<br>of the <span class="accent-text">9 to 5.</span></h1>
    <p class="lead" style="margin-left:0">NoBossly is a free workspace and community for people building a business around a job. Run the business from a workspace set up for what you're building: your numbers, boards, worksheets and money in one place. Talk shop, trade help and find collaborators with other members. And if you're in an accelerator or a course, your program can run its private cohort here too.</p>
    <div class="cta-row" style="justify-content:flex-start">
      <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="/signup">Join free →</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg" href="/how-it-works">How it works</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <img class="hero-img img-fade" src="https://pub-95ede4ca0cce4b26aa322170b1a5b9f1.r2.dev/Site%20Images/light-bulb_p2diod.png" alt="A way out of the day job, lit up">
</section>

<div class="marquee" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="marquee-track">
    <span>Free, no card ✦ Ask and answer ✦ Trade skills ✦ Find collaborators ✦ Groups and weekly challenges ✦ A workspace for your kind of business ✦ Private cohorts for programs ✦ Built for evenings and weekends ✦&nbsp;</span><span>Free, no card ✦ Ask and answer ✦ Trade skills ✦ Find collaborators ✦ Groups and weekly challenges ✦ A workspace for your kind of business ✦ Private cohorts for programs ✦ Built for evenings and weekends ✦&nbsp;</span>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="home-sides reveal reveal-up">
  <div class="card home-side">
    <p class="home-kicker">The community</p>
    <h2>💬 People building the same way</h2>
    <p class="muted">Everyone who joins can use it. Ask a question and hear from members who've been there. Offer what you're good at, or swap it for what you need.</p>
    <ul class="feature-list">
      <li><strong>Feed and Q&amp;A</strong>: post what you're working on, ask what you're stuck on</li>
      <li><strong>Help &amp; exchange</strong>: ask for help with a website, pricing or sales, offer yours, or trade skills</li>
      <li><strong>Get feedback</strong> on your idea, pitch or landing page from other members</li>
      <li><strong>Groups</strong> around a niche, an industry or a goal. Start your own</li>
      <li><strong>Collaborators</strong>: find a business partner, or someone with the skill you're missing</li>
      <li><strong>Weekly challenges</strong>: pick your own goal for the week and work on it alongside other members</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div class="card home-side">
    <p class="home-kicker">For programs</p>
    <h2>🔒 Bring your accelerator or course</h2>
    <p class="muted">NoBossly doesn't teach; programs do. Accelerators, incubators and teachers run their cohorts here, invite-only, and their participants use the same workspace for the work. Nothing in a cohort is visible to anyone outside it: not the posts, not the members, not the work.</p>
    <ul class="feature-list">
      <li><strong>Join by invite link</strong> from your program</li>
      <li><strong>Assignments</strong>: your Lean Canvas by Friday, your pricing, your pitch</li>
      <li><strong>Hand in a copy</strong> of your work. Your own workspace stays private</li>
      <li><strong>Feedback</strong> from your program team, and resubmit until it's right</li>
      <li><strong>A weekly check-in thread</strong> with the rest of your cohort</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="muted small">Running a program? Your team gets a private home for its cohorts, invite links, and an activity view that shows who's moving and who's gone quiet. It shows counts and dates, never what anyone wrote.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<% if (typeof paths !== 'undefined' && paths && paths.length) { %>
<section class="reveal reveal-up" id="paths">
  <div class="page-head">
    <div>
      <h2>A dashboard for what you're actually building</h2>
      <p class="muted">A YouTuber and a café owner don't need the same dashboard. Pick your path and answer a few questions, about a minute, and yours is set up with the numbers, boards and tools for that kind of business.</p>
    </div>
    <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/paths">Compare the paths →</a>
  </div>
  <div class="home-paths">
    <% paths.forEach(function (p) { %>
      <a class="home-path" href="/paths/<%= p.slug %>">
        <span class="hp-emoji"><%= p.emoji %></span>
        <strong><%= p.label %></strong>
      </a>
    <% }) %>
  </div>
</section>
<% } %>

<section class="feature-row reveal reveal-left">
  <div>
    <h2>📊 Your dashboard, your numbers</h2>
    <p class="muted">Each path keeps the numbers you'd want in front of you, and boards for the work in progress.</p>
    <ul class="feature-list">
      <li><strong>Creators</strong> log followers or subscribers and income, run a content pipeline with a publish calendar, and track brand deals</li>
      <li><strong>Freelancers</strong> track billable income and hours, a client pipeline, invoices, and proposals</li>
      <li><strong>Local services</strong> run a jobs board, keep regular customers on a cycle, and quote in a minute</li>
      <li><strong>Shops and cafés</strong> compare premises, plan opening day, track funding, and check break-even before signing a lease</li>
      <li><strong>Online stores and product makers</strong> see real margin after fees and shipping, landed cost, and suppliers side by side</li>
      <li><strong>Apps and software</strong> scope the first version, log sign-ups and paying customers, and keep a roadmap of what users ask for</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <img class="img-corner-fade" src="https://pub-95ede4ca0cce4b26aa322170b1a5b9f1.r2.dev/Site%20Images/light-bulb_2_mns1wm.png" alt="A dashboard shaped by your path" loading="lazy">
</section>

<section class="feature-row single reveal reveal-right">
  <div>
    <h2>🧰 A workspace for the whole business</h2>
    <p class="muted">All free, all private to you. Share a document with someone when you choose, or hand in a copy if you're in a program.</p>
    <ul class="feature-list">
      <li>Lean Canvas and Business Model Canvas</li>
      <li>Customer persona, idea refiner, and elevator pitch, with every version kept</li>
      <li>Business plan builder, goals, and a milestone tracker</li>
      <li>Tasks, a budgeter, and an income log</li>
      <li>A survey maker: share a link, no account needed to answer, results on your dashboard</li>
      <li>Tax Set-Aside, Pricing &amp; Margin, a public Proof Page, and a customer-interview log</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="feature-row single reveal reveal-left">
  <div>
    <h2>🌙 Built for the hours you have left</h2>
    <p class="muted">NoBossly assumes you haven't quit: you have a job, a commute, and a few evenings a week that are yours. Everything opens where you left it, works on your phone, and keeps your numbers and notes in one place, so a spare hour goes on the business and not on finding things.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="feature-row single reveal reveal-right">
  <div>
    <h2>📚 Reference, free and open</h2>
    <p class="muted">Over a hundred reference pages on the paperwork: registering a business where you live, EINs, licences, sales tax, contracts, and tax while you're still employed. Free to read, no account needed.</p>
    <div class="cta-row" style="justify-content:flex-start;margin-top:.9rem">
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/guides">Browse the reference</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/locations">By location</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta-band reveal reveal-up">
  <h2>Keep the job. Build the way out.</h2>
  <p class="muted">Free, no card. Join, pick your path, and your workspace is ready in about a minute.</p>
  <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" style="margin-top:1.1rem;display:inline-block" href="/signup">Join free →</a>
</section>
<style>
  .home-sides { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(18rem, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; margin: 2rem 0; }
  .home-side h2 { margin-top: .2rem; }
  .home-kicker { font-size: .75rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent); margin: 0; }
  .home-paths { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(10rem, 1fr)); gap: .6rem; margin-top: 1rem; }
  .home-path {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .6rem; text-decoration: none; color: var(--text);
    background: var(--panel-2); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; padding: .8rem .9rem;
  }
  .home-path:hover { border-color: var(--accent); }
  .hp-emoji { font-size: 1.35rem; line-height: 1; flex: none; }
  .home-path strong { font-size: .95rem; line-height: 1.2; }
</style>
<script src="/js/home.js?v=5"></script>
<%- include('partials/foot') %>
